{"strongs": "H0530", "word": "אֱמוּנָה", "translit": "e.mu.nah", "root": "אמונה", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "firmness, steadfastness, fidelity", "definition": "אֱמוּנָה noun feminine firmness, steadfastness, fidelity Exod 17:12 + 46 t.; אֱמוּנוֺת Prov 28:20 . 1. literally firmness, steadiness: Exod 17:12 ׳ וַיְהִי יָדָיו א his hands were steadiness (i.e. steady). 2. stead-fastness , אֱמוּנַת עִתֶּיךָ steadfastness of thy times Isa 33:6 . 3. faithfulness, trust: \\ \\ a. of human conduct Ps 37:3 ; Prov 12:22 ; Jer 5:3 ; Jer 7:28 ; Jer 9:2 ; 2Kgs 12:16 in office 2Kgs 22:7 ; 2Kgs 2:9 ; 2Kgs 31:12 ; 2Kgs 34:12 ( על ) בֶּאֱמוּנָה in trust (over) 1Chr 9:22 ; 1Chr 9:26 ; 1Chr 9:31 ; 2Chr 31:15 ; 2Chr 31:18 ׳ דֶּרֶח א Ps 119:30 אִישׁ אֱמוּנוֺת man of great faithfulness Prov 28:20 associated with צֶדֶק in human character יַגִּיד צֶדֶק ׳ יָפִיחַ א who breatheth out faithfulness sheweth forth righteousness Prov 12:17 compare1 Sam Prov 26:23 ; Isa 59:4 ; Jer 5:1 צַדִּיק בֶּאֱמוּנָתוֺ יִחְיֶה a righteous man by his faithfulness liveth Hab 2:4 (> faith Luth AV RV ). b. as a divine attribute Ps 88:12 ; Ps 89:2 ; Ps 89:3 ; Ps 89:6 ; Ps 89:9 ; Isa 25:1 ; Hos 2:22 ; Lam 3:21 אֵל אֱמוּנָה Deut 32:4 his faithfulness is shewn in his works Ps 33:4 commands Ps 119:86 in affliction Ps 119:75 in his oath to David Ps 89:50 . it reacheth unto the skies Ps 36:6 unto all generations Ps 100:5 ; Ps 119:90 he will not belie it Ps 89:34 . It is אֱמוּנָה אֹמֶן Isa 25:1 compare אֱמוּנָה מְאֹד Ps 119:138 . It is closely associated with the divine חֶסֶד mercy Ps 89:25 ; Ps 92:3 ; Ps 98:3 ; Hos 2:22 with the divine צדֶק , צְדָקָה Ps 96:13 ; Ps 143:1 ; Isa 11:5 & salvation Ps 40:11 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB532')\">BDB532</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H530')\">H530</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB531')\">BDB531</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB533')\">BDB533</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אֱמוּנָה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>firmness, steadfastness, fidelity</highlightword> <ref ref=\"Exod 17:12\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(2,17,12)\">Exod 17:12</ref> + 46 t.; <bdbheb>אֱמוּנוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 28:20\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(20,28,20)\">Prov 28:20</ref>. <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> literally <highlight>firmness, steadiness:</highlight> <ref ref=\"Exod 17:12\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(2,17,12)\">Exod 17:12</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וַיְהִי יָדָיו א</bdbheb> <highlight>his hands were steadiness</highlight> (i.e. steady). 2. <highlight>stead-fastness</highlight>, <bdbheb>אֱמוּנַת עִתֶּיךָ</bdbheb> <highlight>steadfastness of thy times</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 33:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,33,6)\">Isa 33:6</ref>. 3. <highlight>faithfulness, trust:</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <highlight>of human conduct</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ps 37:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,37,3)\">Ps 37:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 12:22\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(20,12,22)\">Prov 12:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 5:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,5,3)\">Jer 5:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 7:28\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(24,7,28)\">Jer 7:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 9:2\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(24,9,2)\">Jer 9:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 12:16\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(12,12,16)\">2Kgs 12:16</ref> in office <ref ref=\"2Kgs 22:7\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(12,22,7)\">2Kgs 22:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 2:9\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(12,2,9)\">2Kgs 2:9</ref>; <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"2Kgs 31:12\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(12,31,12)\">2Kgs 31:12</ref>; <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"2Kgs 34:12\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(12,34,12)\">2Kgs 34:12</ref> (<bdbheb>על</bdbheb>) <bdbheb>בֶּאֱמוּנָה</bdbheb> <highlight>in trust</highlight> (over) <ref ref=\"1Chr 9:22\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,22)\">1Chr 9:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 9:26\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,26)\">1Chr 9:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 9:31\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,31)\">1Chr 9:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 31:15\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(14,31,15)\">2Chr 31:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 31:18\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(14,31,18)\">2Chr 31:18</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>דֶּרֶח א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 119:30\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,30)\">Ps 119:30</ref> <bdbheb>אִישׁ אֱמוּנוֺת</bdbheb> <highlight>man of great faithfulness</highlight> <ref ref=\"Prov 28:20\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(20,28,20)\">Prov 28:20</ref> associated with <bdbheb>צֶדֶק</bdbheb> in human character <bdbheb>יַגִּיד צֶדֶק</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יָפִיחַ א</bdbheb> <highlight>who breatheth out faithfulness sheweth forth righteousness</highlight> <ref ref=\"Prov 12:17\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(20,12,17)\">Prov 12:17</ref> compare1 Sam <ref ref=\"Prov 26:23\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(20,26,23)\">Prov 26:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 59:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"59\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"59\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,59,4)\">Isa 59:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 5:1\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(24,5,1)\">Jer 5:1</ref> <bdbheb>צַדִּיק בֶּאֱמוּנָתוֺ יִחְיֶה</bdbheb> <highlight>a righteous man by his faithfulness liveth</highlight> <ref ref=\"Hab 2:4\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(35,2,4)\">Hab 2:4</ref> (&gt; <highlight>faith</highlight> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Lu')\">Luth</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('AV')\"><reflink>AV</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('RV')\"><reflink>RV</reflink></lookup>). b. <highlight>as a divine attribute</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ps 88:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"88\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"88\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,88,12)\">Ps 88:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 89:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,2)\">Ps 89:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 89:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,3)\">Ps 89:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 89:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,6)\">Ps 89:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 89:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,9)\">Ps 89:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 25:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,25,1)\">Isa 25:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hos 2:22\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(28,2,22)\">Hos 2:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lam 3:21\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(25,3,21)\">Lam 3:21</ref> <bdbheb>אֵל אֱמוּנָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 32:4\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,4)\">Deut 32:4</ref> his faithfulness is shewn in his works <ref ref=\"Ps 33:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,33,4)\">Ps 33:4</ref> commands <ref ref=\"Ps 119:86\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"86\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"86\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,86)\">Ps 119:86</ref> in affliction <ref ref=\"Ps 119:75\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"75\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"75\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,75)\">Ps 119:75</ref> in his oath to David <ref ref=\"Ps 89:50\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"50\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"50\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,50)\">Ps 89:50</ref>. it reacheth unto the skies <ref ref=\"Ps 36:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,36,6)\">Ps 36:6</ref> unto all generations <ref ref=\"Ps 100:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"100\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"100\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,100,5)\">Ps 100:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 119:90\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"90\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"90\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,90)\">Ps 119:90</ref> he will not belie it <ref ref=\"Ps 89:34\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,34)\">Ps 89:34</ref>. It is <bdbheb>אֱמוּנָה אֹמֶן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 25:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,25,1)\">Isa 25:1</ref> compare <bdbheb>אֱמוּנָה מְאֹד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 119:138\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"138\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"138\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,138)\">Ps 119:138</ref>. It is closely associated with the divine <bdbheb>חֶסֶד</bdbheb> <highlight>mercy</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ps 89:25\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,25)\">Ps 89:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 92:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"92\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"92\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,92,3)\">Ps 92:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 98:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"98\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"98\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,98,3)\">Ps 98:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hos 2:22\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(28,2,22)\">Hos 2:22</ref> with the divine <bdbheb>צדֶק</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>צְדָקָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 96:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"96\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"96\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,96,13)\">Ps 96:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 143:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"143\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"143\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,143,1)\">Ps 143:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 11:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,11,5)\">Isa 11:5</ref> &amp; salvation <ref ref=\"Ps 40:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,40,11)\">Ps 40:11</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Exod 17:12", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 17, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Prov 28:20", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 28, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "Isa 33:6", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 33, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Ps 37:3", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 37, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Prov 12:22", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 12, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Jer 5:3", "book": "JER", "chapter": 5, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Jer 7:28", "book": "JER", "chapter": 7, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "Jer 9:2", "book": "JER", "chapter": 9, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "2Kgs 12:16", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 12, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "2Kgs 22:7", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 22, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "2Kgs 2:9", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 2, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "2Kgs 31:12", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 31, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "2Kgs 34:12", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 34, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "1Chr 9:22", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 9, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "1Chr 9:26", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 9, "verse": 26}, {"raw": "1Chr 9:31", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 9, "verse": 31}, {"raw": "2Chr 31:15", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 31, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "2Chr 31:18", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 31, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Ps 119:30", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 119, "verse": 30}, {"raw": "Prov 12:17", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 12, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Prov 26:23", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 26, "verse": 23}, {"raw": "Isa 59:4", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 59, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Jer 5:1", "book": "JER", "chapter": 5, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Hab 2:4", "book": "HAB", "chapter": 2, "verse": 4},